criteria.text:
(P2) With a daily figure declared and the day's recorded use below
   it, the facts printed at a prompt carry the day's use and the figure;
   with the use at or above it they also carry the stopping advisory;
   with a dollar figure and a model that has no declared price they
   carry the day's tokens and print `unknown` for the estimate; with no
   figure declared they are the facts printed before this part.

The consumer selection (WO-213-D014) is kept: in a kit root `npm test`
    and `npm test -- --review` run the six structural tasks and `kit-verify`
    fresh and append the declared instance suites criterion 18 selects, run
    fresh; no carried kit suite enters either selection and no row is reused;
    outside a kit root, selection and reuse equal today's (runner fixtures;
    one export case).
